# Windows scripts must keep CRLF line endings wherever they are checked out:
# cmd.exe can mis-parse labels/goto in an LF-only .bat, and the release ZIP and
# the script asset are built from a checkout. Everything else: let Git decide.
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
